# Renode Multi-Node Distributed Architecture Simulation Script
# 
# Architecture:
# - ESP32_Master_Matrix:  Master controller driving the 300-LED 2D Matrix (15x20)
# - ESP32_Slave_Strip1:   Slave node 1 driving 150 LEDs (30/m 5m strip)
# - ESP32_Slave_Strip2:   Slave node 2 driving 150 LEDs (30/m 5m strip)
# - ESP32_Slave_Strip3:   Slave node 3 driving 300 LEDs (60/m 5m strip)
#
# Inter-node Sync: WLED-ESP-NOW / DDP / UDP Sync over simulated wireless medium

using sysbus

echo "========================================================"
echo "🌐 Initializing Renode Multi-Node Wireless Emulation"
echo "========================================================"

# 1. Create Shared Wireless Medium for ESP-NOW / DDP UDP Sync
emulation CreateWirelessMedium "wifi_medium"

# 2. Master Node: ESP32 2D Matrix (300 LEDs)
mach create "ESP32_Master_Matrix"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @simulation/renode/esp32.repl
sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/esp32dev/firmware.elf
showAnalyzer uart0
echo "  [+] Node 1 (Master 2D Matrix 300 LEDs) Initialized"

# 3. Slave Node 1: Strip 1 (150 LEDs)
mach create "ESP32_Slave_Strip1"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @simulation/renode/esp32.repl
sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/esp32dev/firmware.elf
showAnalyzer uart0
echo "  [+] Node 2 (Slave Strip 1 - 150 LEDs) Initialized"

# 4. Slave Node 2: Strip 2 (150 LEDs)
mach create "ESP32_Slave_Strip2"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @simulation/renode/esp32.repl
sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/esp32dev/firmware.elf
showAnalyzer uart0
echo "  [+] Node 3 (Slave Strip 2 - 150 LEDs) Initialized"

# 5. Slave Node 3: Strip 3 (300 LEDs)
mach create "ESP32_Slave_Strip3"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @simulation/renode/esp32.repl
sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/esp32dev/firmware.elf
showAnalyzer uart0
echo "  [+] Node 4 (Slave Strip 3 - 300 LEDs) Initialized"

echo "========================================================"
echo "🚀 Starting Distributed 4-Node Emulation Network..."
echo "========================================================"
start
